er loot to help prepare for quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174440/extras/e9f092009f08060c4ccda51c57ab6fb9.poster.avif?t=1754189818\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174440/extras/e9f092009f08060c4ccda51c57ab6fb9.webm?t=1754189818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174440/extras/e9f092009f08060c4ccda51c57ab6fb9.mp4?t=1754189818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
